# Protected spending

Things you value and don't want Claude to suggest cutting. Copy to my-preferences.md (gitignored).

- Example: travel. Actions on trips aim for the same travel for less, never less travel.

# Subscription decisions

One line per subscription, kept up by the review. Verdict is Keep, Cancel or Deciding (with a decide-by date).

- Example streaming: Keep. Reviewed 2026-01-15. Watched weekly.
